Hello,

 

I have a trivial question which I cannot answer. How to say in Lojban “depends” (in physical or mathematical sence)? In the list of gismu I have found the following two possibilities.


1. lacri [ lac ] rely 

x1 relies/depends/counts on/trusts x2 to bring about/ensure/maintain x3 (event/state) 


2. fancu [ ] function 
x1 is a function/single-valued mapping from domain x2 to range x3 defined by expression/rule x4 

 

However the first one I do not like since it is related with such subjective terms as “relies” and “trusts”. The second option is problematic since fancu is a single-valued mapping and I need to describe many variable function.


